export anchor BioluminescentStyle:
    number: 270
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Bioluminescent
    idea: Files drift as rounded capsules in blue black deep water, lit only by glowing cyan rings, a depth gauge for storage and a round porthole for the selected file.
    base: dark
    palette:
        deep: #020d15, page floor and gauge well
        water: #041824, page top, search and fact cells
        capsule: #072535, file capsules and the details panel
        capsuleLit: #0a3448, the selected capsule and the active view
        ink: #def7fa, text
        muted: #93b8c2, meta and inactive rail labels
        line: #0f3a4c, capsule and panel edges
        cyanGlow: #3fe6ee, primary button, current ring, folder orbs, gauge, porthole rim and focus
        foam: #a6f5e4, file icons and status words
        cyanInk: #00262b, text on cyan
    type:
        One humanist stack, Seravek, Gill Sans Nova, Gill Sans, Trebuchet
        MS, Segoe UI. Base 16px. The title is 40px at 500, the details
        title 20px at 600, file names 16px at 600, meta 14px muted, rail
        labels 12px.
    layout:
        The page is deep water, a soft lighter glow at the top and scattered
        blurred cyan plankton dots. A 104px rail holds a ringed B mark,
        the five places as round outlined icon rings with small labels
        beneath, My files ring glowing cyan, and at the foot a vertical
        depth gauge filled 64.2 percent with 64.2 GB of 100 GB. The main
        area has the breadcrumb and a pill search, then the title with a
        glowing Upload pill, a New folder outline pill and a List or Grid
        pill switch. Files are 40px round capsules with a round orb icon,
        the name with its status word, a sentence of kind, date and
        person, and the size. Folder orbs glow cyan. The selected capsule
        has a cyan rim and glow. A 340px rounded details panel has a small
        glowing jellyfish drawing in its corner, a 200px round porthole
        preview, the name, four fact cells and the three pill buttons.
        Below 760px the rail becomes a top strip with a horizontal gauge.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 36px main padding, 10px between capsules, 24px inside the porthole panel.
    density: Medium. One capsule per file, about 70px tall, with a sentence of meta.
    corners: Fully round. 40px capsules, 28px panel, 22px pill buttons and fields, circle orbs and porthole.
    borders: 1px #0f3a4c edges, teal orb rims, cyan rims on folders, the selected capsule and the porthole.
    shadows: Glow only, 0 0 12px cyan at 45 percent, on the primary button, current ring, selected capsule, gauge and meters.
    icons:
        20px line icons in foam inside round orbs. Status words in foam
        pair a filled star with Starred, two heads with Shared with 4
        people and an up arrow ring with Uploading 62% over a glowing bar.
    focus: A 2px cyan outline with a 3px offset plus the cyan glow.
    tone: Quiet and plain, such as Details and 64.2 GB of 100 GB, with the sea only in the visuals.
